'''Mega Blaziken ex''' (Japanese: '''メガバシャーモex''' ''Mega Bursyamo ex'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

