==Trivia==
*The Immersive card features {{p|Hitmonchan}}, {{p|Tauros}}, {{p|Jolteon}}, Mega {{p|Blaziken}}, {{p|Luxray}}, {{p|Archeops}}, {{p|Greninja}}, {{p|Aegislash}}, {{p|Melmetal}} and {{p|Corviknight}}.
===Origin===
*This card features [[Mega]] {{p|Blaziken}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}. It refers to Blaziken and has not been previously used for Mega Blaziken. This is because Mega Blaziken had no Pokédex entry from [[Generation VII]], and unlike [[Mega Altaria ex (Mega Rising 102)|Mega Altaria]], it did not receive one in the newly released base game of {{g|Legends: Z-A}}.

